    "title": "OU Health to acquire eye institute - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Madeline Ashley ,\n1 days ago Oklahoma City-based OU Health has signed a letter of intent to acquire the Dean McGee Eye Institute, also in Oklahoma City. The transaction, which is expected to be finalized by Jan. 1, will create the OU Health Dean McGee Eye Institute and further integrate the institute into OU Health’s academic mission, according to a Dec. 23 news release shared with Becker’s. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
